@drag0nm/pare-dsh README · The pinned core：For development, point `parePath` (plugin option) or the `PARE_CORE_PATH` environment variable at your own `pare.exe` (`go build -o pare.exe ./cmd/pare`). No hash check is done then; only the protocol name is checked.

For offline machines, place the same file (matching SHA-256) at `%LOCALAPPDATA%\Pare\core\pare-0.4.0.exe`, or set `parePath`.

`timeoutMs` is the per-call timeout, 600000 ms by default.

@drag0nm/pare-dsh README · 固定版本的核心：开发时可以用 `parePath` 配置或环境变量 `PARE_CORE_PATH` 指向自己构建的 `pare.exe`（`go build -o pare.exe ./cmd/pare`）。此时不做哈希校验，只检查协议名。

离线环境可以把同一个文件（SHA-256 一致）放到 `%LOCALAPPDATA%\Pare\core\pare-0.4.0.exe`，或设置 `parePath`。

`timeoutMs` 是单次调用的超时，默认 600000 毫秒。
